72
00:05:15,417 --> 00:05:19,440
The two edits are the last two of five
listed

73
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:22,298
differences, behind three that are not
edits.

74
00:05:22,358 --> 00:05:24,340
The list is not scored.

75
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:29,708
On three check readers, eighteen edits
were injected and one was flagged.

76
00:05:29,768 --> 00:05:34,078
Fourteen of the fifteen that move away
from the reference were

77
00:05:34,138 --> 00:05:38,448
flagged or listed, but the list has five
entries with or

78
00:05:38,508 --> 00:05:43,216
