79
00:05:43,276 --> 00:05:48,381
Unedited reader pairs give six false
regions in seven point seven six minutes.

80
00:05:48,441 --> 00:05:51,559
For another speaker, a score of one
hundred

81
00:05:51,619 --> 00:05:54,340
means only that nothing crossed the
thresholds.

82
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,749
Now a live upload.

83
00:05:56,809 --> 00:06:01,272
I open Analyse your own recording and
choose a file

84
00:06:01,332 --> 00:06:04,891
from the dataset: John Greenman's reading
with two

85
00:06:04,951 --> 00:06:08,962
